---
---

<section aria-label="Our approach" class="approach">
  <div class="approach-grid">
    <div class="approach-media">
      <img 
        src="/Modern_suspension_bridge_archite…_202609061943.jpeg" 
        alt="Modern suspension bridge architecture" 
        loading="lazy" 
        decoding="async"
        width="1000"
        height="800"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="approach-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">How We Think</span>
      <h2>Built to bridge strategy and execution</h2>
      <p>
        Plans fail in the gap between the boardroom and the front line. We work inside that gap —
        senior enough to set direction, hands-on enough to deliver it — so nothing gets lost
        crossing from decision to result.
      </p>
      <a href="/how-we-work.html" class="btn btn-primary">See How We Work &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .approach { padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .approach-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; min-height: 420px; }
  .approach-media { overflow: hidden; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .approach-media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(20%) contrast(1.05); }
  .approach-copy { padding: 64px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
  .approach-copy h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px); letter-spacing: -0.4px; margin: 16px 0 16px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--navy); }
  .approach-copy p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 26px; max-width: 460px; }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .approach-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .approach-media { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); min-height: 280px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .approach-copy { padding: 40px 24px; }
  }
</style>
